%% title: From a student to a guardian's account
%% desc: A guardian is added when a student is added. Office staff fix the guardian's details in the guardian list. The Admin sends invitations. The guardian starts an account and sees their child's attendance, fees and messages.
flowchart LR
  S["Add student<br/>with guardian"]:::admin --> L["Guardian list"]
  L --> E["Fix details<br/>phone, relationship"]:::note
  L --> I["Admin<br/>sends invitations"]:::admin
  I --> A["Guardian<br/>starts account"]:::guardian
  A --> V["Child's attendance,<br/>fees and messages"]:::guardian
  classDef teacher fill:#e7f5ff,stroke:#1c7ed6,color:#0b3d66
  classDef admin fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#e8590c,color:#7a2e05
  classDef guardian fill:#ebfbee,stroke:#2b8a3e,color:#14411d
  classDef note fill:#f1f3f5,stroke:#868e96,color:#343a40
